 "remarks": "Palmer Hill! The luxury gated community located on the Old Greenwich/Stamford border. MOVE RIGHT IN to this sunny, freshly painted, open plan 2 bedroom/2 bath condo, with all wood floors, and a private tree line view. This home has everything you could want for an easy, carefree lifestyle. Gourmet kitchen with freshly painted cabinetry, granite counters, and SS appliances. The sunny living/dining room has a gas fireplace, and French doors to a private tree view terrace with new flooring. The large Primary Bedroom Suite has new wood flooring, a custom walk in closet, and French doors to the terrace. The luxury en-suite marble, bath has a double sink vanity, and whirlpool tub/shower. A 2nd bedroom with wood floors and full bath complete this home. There is a washer and dryer in this home. 2 parking spaces in the indoor garage, a storage unit, and a bike room are included. Amenities include a newly renovated clubhouse, pool, hot tub, fire pit, gym, yoga room, and business center. This is a DOG FRIENDLY community. Minutes to I95 and Metro North. A Gem and Must See Home!",
